/* Quote text in LVUP_TEXT_BASE order (poor, good, great per character).
 *
 * Plain ASCII only: the unit speaks through the portrait already on the
 * level-up screen, so no [Open...] / [LoadFace] codes are needed. Leave a
 * quote empty (just the terminating BYTE 0) to skip the speech for that tier.
 * Split long quotes over two lines with BYTE $01 ([NL]) between the halves. */

